!!! definition "Definition 123.20: Outer Product Operator"
    Suppose $|v\rangle$ is a vector in an inner product space $V$, and $|w\rangle$ is a vector in an inner product space $W$.

    Define $|w\rangle\langle v|$ to be the linear operator from $V$ to $W$ whose action on $|v'\rangle$ is

